      "notes": "<h2> Meaning of Chemistry</h2>\n  <h3> DEEP EXPLANATION</h3>\n  <p>\n  Chemistry is the scientific study of <strong>matter</strong>, including its \n  composition, structure, properties, and the changes it undergoes during reactions.\n  </p>\n  <h3> BREAKDOWN</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Matter:</strong> Anything with mass and space</li>\n    <li><strong>Composition:</strong> What substances are made of (atoms, molecules)</li>\n    <li><strong>Structure:</strong> Arrangement of particles</li>\n    <li><strong>Properties:</strong> Physical and chemical characteristics</li>\n    <li><strong>Changes:</strong> Reactions forming new substances</li>\n  </ul>\n  <h3> APPLICATIONS</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Medicine and healthcare</li>\n    <li>Food production</li>\n    <li>Energy generation</li>\n    <li>Manufacturing industries</li>\n  </ul>\n  ",
